Z||000012||onfire||12-03-2000||11:46 PM||||Here is a pic of the mother board I have. You can clearly see the difference of a PCI slot and an ISA slot. The agp slot is for video cards, but have no fear if you don't have one they make video cards for the pci slot as well. So if you buy one make sure you know what you have. Anyway if you have anymore questions feel free to ask.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/files/k7m.JPG"> <P>------------------<BR>"I seen it on the internet, and I believe everthing on the net."<BR><A HREF="http://homestead.deja.com/user.on_fire/on_fire.html" TARGET=_blank>Check out my waist of banbwidth.</A>||||reg||1
